@startuml SITE-05
!include ../theme.puml
title SITE-05 — Sitemap Manager Workspace
rectangle "/manager/dashboard" as Dashboard
rectangle "/manager/photographers" as Photographers
rectangle "/manager/reports" as Reports
rectangle "/manager/bookings" as Bookings
rectangle "/manager/support" as Support
rectangle "/manager/audit" as Audit
Dashboard --> Photographers
Dashboard --> Reports
Dashboard --> Bookings
Dashboard --> Support
Dashboard --> Audit
Photographers --> Photographers : detail + approve/reject
Reports --> Reports : detail + investigate + resolve
Bookings --> Bookings : metadata + resolve dispute
Support --> Support : assign + reply + resolve
note bottom
  Dedicated SiteMesh Manager layout; queues are paginated.
  No link or route grants /admin access.
end note
@enduml
